## Key Fixes Summary

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Unprotected map access | RWMutex for all map operations |
| Stats races | Atomic operations |
| Busy-wait polling | Channel-based signaling |
| GetMulti races | WaitGroup + mutex for results |
| Cache stampede | Single loader with channel broadcast |
| cleanup races | Full mutex protection |

The channel-based approach for loading is elegant - first goroutine to miss creates a channel, all subsequent goroutines wait on it. When loading completes, closing the channel wakes everyone up simultaneously. No busy-waiting, no thundering herd on the database.

